**Title:** Whispering Waves and Starlit Dreams

**Description:** Immerse yourself in the tranquil world of Alex, an imaginative eleven-year-old, as they explore the serene coastal shoreline with Tides, their playful otter companion. This gentle journey along the sandy beach unfolds under a starlit sky, inviting listeners to savor the soothing rhythm of the ocean's lullaby. As Alex connects deeply with the natural world, the calming melody of the waves and the soft embrace of a silvery mist foster a profound sense of peace and belonging. Designed to ease anxiety and nurture emotional calm, this story is a perfect companion for a restful night's sleep, inviting you to relax and drift into the gentle embrace of the night.

